  "contract": "After existing expression collection, remove only this slot-pattern owner's TemplateQueryKind::Expression. Retain all CallCallee candidates, complete floating-Promise candidates, source/owner ranges, generated offsets, source ordering and descendant/sibling values.",
  "limits": [
    "Valid computed key patterns are also valid object expressions and are covered here. Binding-pattern defaults that current expression parsing refuses remain unsupported; do not add a parse or claim all patterns complete.",
    "Do not assign end-to-end Promise-key diagnostics without genuine Corsa type probing: Promise keys can introduce real TypeScript errors or recovery types.",
    "Type-known callee and unsafe callee require distinct real-Corsa evaluator controls; complete query retention alone does not prove their diagnostic envelope.",
    "Rows are synthetic transparent span mappings for the existing collector. They do not pretend to be captured real Canon or n8n/router output."
  ],
